# Module Structure

## File Organization

```
src/modules/[module-name]/
├── constants/           # Module-specific constants and enums
├── types/               # TypeScript interfaces and type definitions
├── dto/
│   ├── request/        # DTOs for request validation
│   ├── response/       # Response classes (extend BaseResponseTransformer)
│   └── index.ts        # Export all DTOs
├── [entity].service.ts
├── [entity].controller.ts
└── [module].module.ts
```

## Project Layers

- `src/modules/` - Business feature modules
- `src/common/` - Shared business utilities (types, constants, helpers)
- `src/core/` - Infrastructure (auth, database, i18n, config, shared)

## Naming Conventions

- Files: `kebab-case.ts` (e.g., `user-profile.service.ts`)
- Classes: `PascalCase` (e.g., `UserProfileService`)
- DTOs: `CreateUserDto`, `UpdateUserDto`, `UserResponse`
- Controllers: `@Controller('users')` with plural resource names
